{"title":"2011 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0df81b686ce1f3f975c75fa673f1b73954139e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times (5 - 2) + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1ca274c250a2223ebc5925333519db92a00e8d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 18 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 22 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 24 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 32 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/641c44bb00480bde70e0ed617c54ee7f48816f18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times (5 - 2) + 4 = 6 \\times 3 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce417c311c45d8ba760fbcfdf0a6b4215221635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=18 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/4/c940a458fbe0d7e1ac345f7a71b2b96c8f5042ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/608f9514d4a495ea4e6af9ab5974a0ae25ed75c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\times (5 - 2) + 4 = 6 \\times 5 - 6 \\times 2 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"278\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe048e8340770b44fa92f7a75f3e9ab3a3333d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=30 - 12 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce417c311c45d8ba760fbcfdf0a6b4215221635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=18 + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/4/c940a458fbe0d7e1ac345f7a71b2b96c8f5042ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2011 CEMC Pascal\">2011 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" cl